at|^j TABLE OF CONTENTS|fp||

ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Two good rules when bidding close major suit games^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  New Minor Forcing vs Checkback Stayman^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Discarding when declarer runs a long suit is very difficult^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  You can overcall with 10+ points or so^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Strain to open or overcall 1N whenever you can^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


