pc|HT|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Leading a singleton against a suit contract is often a good idea.|
PG| ***** 8 ***** |


pc|H5|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|pc|HK|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West should play low on the heart. Partner does not have the @HA or @HQ. By playing the @HK West gave declarer an extra trick.|
