UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East/West in 5@C lose 1 heart, 1 spade, 1 club and 2 diamonds down 3, for -500 if doubled. That is slightly worse than our 450, or 420 with perfect defense.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now let me discuss two good rules when bidding close major suit games. You should stretch when a) you have a 9 card fit or b) you have a singleton, particularly in the opponents' suit. North had both of those which is why 4@S was a good bid over 3@C--limit raise--by South.|
PG| ***** 21 ***** |


