mb|P|mb|1D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P|mb|2N|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now East needs to find out if West has 3 hearts. For this purpose, most players play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,New Minor Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at| meaning they bid 3@C and partner bids 3@H with three hearts or 3@S with four spades, or 3N with neither.|
PG| ***** 24 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I prefer |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at| to |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,New Minor Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at| which on this hand is still 3@C. The only difference is partner bids 3@D with neither three hearts nor four spades.|
PG| ***** 25 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I suggest you play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at| rather than |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,New Minor Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at| in general. The main difference between the two is a) 3@C is |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at| on this auction whether you opened 1@C or 1@D. And had you rebid 1N, 2@C would be |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at| whether you had opened 1@C or 1@D. And b) if you have neither 3 card support in partner's suit or 4 of the other major you bid 2@D rather than bidding 2N which is what you do with |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,New Minor Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at|.|
PG| ***** 26 ***** |


mb|3C|mb|P?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now here Wests bid 3@D if 3@C is |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at|. The reason |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at| is better is it keeps the auction more flexible with the 3@D bid rather than 3N, although on this particular hand it makes no difference.|
PG| ***** 27 ***** |


mb|3D|mb|P|mb|3N|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
