nt|^z@3^b@2^^|
pc|S2|pc|SJ|pc|S5|pc|S3|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The @SJ is okay, as, given the spade lead, it rates to win but there was no reason to take the spade finesse right away. You can play low and take it later.|
PG| ***** 29 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has 9 sure tricks. 5 hearts, 3 spades, and a diamond. However, West can possibly take extra tricks by taking repeated diamond finesses before running hearts.|
