up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As you noticed, discarding when declarer runs a long suit is very difficult and the opponents often guess wrong here. Perfect defense holds me to 4 as I can take 5 diamonds, 3 hearts and 2 spades.|
