mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree with East pass particularly given the singleton heart and four clubs which means it is quite possible the hand is a misfit. The other possible bid which I don't like as much but could work out is a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=negativedoubles,Negative Double^*N|CP||FP||at|, which simply shows spades, not spades and diamonds. Although if partner rebids 2@H East won't be happy. So I think pass is much better.|
PG| ***** 74 ***** |


mb|P|mb|2D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I would pass with the East hand. 3@D is not terrible, although partner might only have four.|
