mb|1C|mb|1N|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think 1NT is the best call. Some players might double, being worried about the doubleton club. However, you should strain to open or overcall 1N whenever you can. It is much more precise than other calls and typically leads to more accurate auctions.|
